>> servings: 4

Add @water{1%cup}(boiling) to a #bowl{}.
Whisk @nut butter{2%tbsp}, @honey{1%tbsp}, @cinnamon{1%tsp} into bowl.
Add @rolled oats{2%cup}.
Add @plant-based milk{} to bowl.
Add enough because the oats will absorb overnight.
Add @chia seeds{1/4%cup} and @salt{}.
Leave in fridge overnight.

In the morning add @apple{1}(grated), and any toppings of your choice.
